  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "gr-past-irregular",
  "connector": "went, ate…",
  "gloss": "形が変わる過去形",
  "title": "went, ate, saw — 形が変わる過去形",
  "pattern": "go → went / eat → ate / see → saw / have → had / come → came / buy → bought",
  "explanation": "よく使う動詞ほど、過去形が -ed ではなく形ごと変わります：go → went、eat → ate、see → saw、have → had、come → came、buy → bought。数は多くないので、よく使うものから1つずつ覚えましょう。",
  "natural": "What did you do yesterday? ―― I went to the beach.（昨日は何したの？ ―― ビーチに行ったよ）",
  "stiff": "goed、eated のように -ed を付けるのは×。did の後では元の形に戻ります：Did you go?（Did you went? は×）。",
  "examples": [
